Subject: [PATCH 02/30] Clip keys: knobs 2-8 send CCs when no mode is on

In clip mode with no SCALE, CHORD or ARP mode on, knobs 2-8 send CC 48-54 on channel 1.
The value is relative (1-63 up, 65-127 down), so no new RAM is necessary.
Loopy Pro can learn the knobs. Knob 1 stays MASTER. No change outside clip mode.
